  "title": "Create: Evil Awake",
  "description": "⚡Create-based modpack with combat mods and bosses!🔥",
  "body": "![Imgur](https://i.imgur.com/s4aXRwm.png)\n\n---\n![Status - In Development](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Archived-red?style=for-the-badge)\n![Version - 1.3.3](https://img.shields.io/badge/Version/Minecraft-1.3.5/1.19.2-red?style=for-the-badge)\n![Loader - Forge](https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Forge-red?style=for-the-badge)\n[![4EEZE#6261](https://img.shields.io/badge/4EEZE%236261-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord)](https://discordid.netlify.app/?id=617963753610280976)\n[![Issues](https://img.shields.io/badge/Issues-grey?style=for-the-badge&logo=github)](https://github.com/4EEZE/Create-Evil-Awake/issues)\n\n![Imgur](https://i.imgur.com/wKyEN0J.png)\n\n### Create: Evil Awake is a modpack based on Create and combat mods with bosses, unique gameplay and atmosphere, optimization and fast support.\n\n---\n\n![Imgur](https://i.imgur.com/yKYqMXK.png)\n\n\n### Because we have:\n\n### 📱Custom and unique menu!📱\n\n### 💿Custom loading screen!💿\n\n### ✨Cool Design!✨\n\n### 🥇Well-chosen mods!🥇\n\n### 🏹More than 100 kinds of armor and more than 30 kinds of weapons!🏹\n\n### 🎃Unique bosses and mini bosses!🎃\n\n### 🌳Cool atmosphere!🌳\n\n---\n\n![Imgur](https://i.imgur.com/hzffWFM.png)\n    \n# 💽System Requirements💾\n\n<details>\n<summary>What if I have low FPS?</summary>\n<br>\n\n - If you have low FPS, try disabling/removing the mod. **Sound Physics Remastered** (realistic behavior of sounds in the game). **[Great performance boost]**\n- Turn off the lush foliage. This can be done by moving the resource pack for disabling above the others. **[Great performance boost]**\n- If you have low FPS, try disabling/removing the mod **Falling Leaves** (falling leaves from trees). \n**[Small performance boost]**\n\n \nThese instructions should help you to increase your FPS.\n \n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>System Requirements MIN/REC</summary>\n<br>\n\n### Minimum system requirements\n- OS: **Windows 7/8/10, macOS, Linux**\n- RAM: **5 — 6 GB**\n- GPU: **NVIDIA GeForce 400 Series or similar AMD card with OpenGL 4.4 support**\n- CPU: **Intel Core i3 or similar AMD processor**\n### Recommended system requirements\n- OS: **Windows 7/8/10, macOS, Linux**\n- RAM: **6 — 8 GB**\n- GPU: **NVIDIA GeForce 700 Series or similar AMD card with OpenGL 4.5 support**\n- CPU: **Intel Core i5 or similar AMD processor**\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n[![Nullscape](https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%2F63272345%2F224808975-6d3866c1-a968-4fa1-a1c1-6d9318e42ed9.png&n=-1)](https://modrinth.com/mod/nullscape)\n[![Undead Unleashed](https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ibb.co%2FPhwsN2n%2F2023-06-24-10-57-3111.png&n=-1)](https://modrinth.com/mod/undead-unleashed)\n[![Integrated API](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/612/340/apibanner1.png)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-api)\n[![More Villagers](https://i.imgur.com/rgWbKwC.png)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-villagers)\n[![Legendary Tooltips](https://i.imgur.com/TJfJlnx.gif)](https://modrinth.com/mod/legendary-tooltips)\n[![Alex's Armoury](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/572/728/logo_alternate_blue_gradient_clear.png)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-armoury)\n[![Effective](https://github.com/Ladysnake/Effective/blob/main/title.png?raw=true)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/effective)\n[![Knight Quest](https://i.imgur.com/zfjoYar.png)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knight-quest)\n[![The conjurer](https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/277654121008126804-The_Conjurer_Promo.png)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-conjurer)\n\n\n\n",
